      "text": "Right, that's enough～"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 20.7,
      "end_time": 21.9,
      "text": "KYAAA!?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 22.1,
      "end_time": 25.5,
      "text": "Geez, let's play nice!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 26.0,
      "end_time": 28.5,
      "text": "The slime will melt your clothes, you know?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 29.0,
      "end_time": 31.5,
      "text": "I was just getting in the mood, too..."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 34.6,
      "end_time": 38.5,
      "text": "Oh gee, the magic tool took over my slime."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 39.0,
      "end_time": 40.9,
      "text": "And it's gone berserk~"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 41.1,
      "end_time": 42.5,
      "text": "Now they really will start melting..."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 43.0,
      "end_time": 44.4,
      "text": "Eh... Kyaa...!?"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 44.5,
      "end_time": 50.6,
      "text": "Actually, if we don't get rid of that that magic tool, it's gonna blow this entire continent to bits~"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 50.9,
      "end_time": 51.6,
      "text": "EHHHHHHH?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 51.8,
      "end_time": 55.0,
      "text": "S-Save me... Misora-chan!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 55.6,
      "end_time": 58.1,
      "text": "*sigh* I guess it really can't be helped."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 62.2,
      "end_time": 64.5,
      "text": "I-I'm... sorry...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 65.2,
      "end_time": 66.7,
      "text": "So, what happens now?"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 67.4,
      "end_time": 70.2,
      "text": "Everyone, let us cooperate for now!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 70.5,
      "end_time": 73.3,
      "text": "I am completely prepared, and entirely on-guard!"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 74.6,
      "end_time": 75.5,
      "text": "Kyaa!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 77.5,
      "end_time": 78.7,
      "text": "KYAAAAAH!?"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 79.3,
      "end_time": 81.5,
      "text": "Fufu. Now's my chance~"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 83.2,
      "end_time": 84.6,
      "text": "Misora-chan, over there!"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
